// Low golden of coro/async-void.oir (V4).
// void.await-for-effect: two void Futures of one owner; each close names the versions of both duties
// that reach it, in own's schedule order.
// Each close settles the versions of both duties that reach it in own's schedule order (OIR-2 §9.3 step 3).
